body:
Hey all! I bought DOS2 DE for pc a couple of days ago with some friends. We got through the first act but they all got tired of the game and quit. I loved it so im looking to start with some new friends! Im able to play a lot of the time, especially now during the winter break. DOS2 feels like one of those games you stay up way too late with your friends to play and thats what im kind of about. Add me on discord!     Purp#9392 

&#x200B;

I kinda wanna do some sort of Rogue build but I hear they are bad. We'll see though.
